Description: Instantiate QuadRFRadio for use_quadrf the same way SimRadio
 is instantiated for use_simradio, and skip the RadioLib SPI HAL setup for
 both soft radios instead of only SimRadio. QuadRFRadio is copied from the adjacent backend directory and needs
 no chip driver underneath it.
